        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1+EXO.27.2+EXO.27.3+EXO.27.4+EXO.27.5+EXO.27.6+EXO.27.7+EXO.27.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 27.1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He made the altar of burnt offering also of acacia wood; five cubits was its length, and five cubits its breadth; it was square, and three cubits was its height. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He made horns for it on its four corners; its horns were of one piece with it, and he overlaid it with bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made all the utensils of the altar, the pots, the shovels, the basins, the forks, and the firepans; all its utensils he made of bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made for the altar a grating, a network of bronze, under its ledge, extending halfway down. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He cast four rings on the four corners of the bronze grating as holders for the poles; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he made the poles of acacia wood, and overlaid them with bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put the poles through the rings on the sides of the altar, to carry it with them; he made it hollow, with boards.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
